{
 "source": "OpenAiResponsesAgentLoopEndToEndTest.toolResultChainedByPreviousResponseIdSelectsTheNextTurn and OpenAiResponsesStateEndToEndTest.chainsAndRetrievesAStreamedToolCallTurnOverTheWire (master b765b8271): OpenAiResponsesStore keeps a turn's issued call ids (issuedToolCalls) and records streamed turns from response.completed (recordStreamedIfStored).",
